  "description": "A forward starts near the blue line and a defender starts in front of the net. The forward rims the puck into the corner and swings to the wall. The defender gets to the puck, checks over the shoulder and passes up the wall to the forward. The forward skates up ice, turns back and attacks; the defender follows the pass and closes the gap for a 1-on-1. Alternate rims and dumps at the goalie.",
